data: {"id": "ccaa9bf4ae33418a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1143", "run_id": "ccaa9bf4ae33418a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "关键事实已明确：\n\n**当前状态确认：**\n- Pod `aiops-case-11/workload` 确实仍处于 **Terminating** 状态，持续 32 分钟\n- `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-03T22:31:03Z` — 删除时间戳已存在约 31 分钟\n- `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0` — 没有宽限期\n- **`finalizers: [\"aiops.lab/hold\"]`** — 存在自定义 finalizer\n- `phase: Running`（Kubernetes 内部 phase，与 Terminating 状态不冲突）\n- 容器 `app` 已终止：exitCode=137（SIGKILL），Started 22:31:00，Finished 22:31:14\n- 事件仅一条：`Killing: Stopping container app`（32m 前）\n- nodeName: node2（非 NotReady 节点）\n- terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 10\n- ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788476611180, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

